# Architecture

- MUST follow Clean Architecture / dependency inversion.
- Domain MUST NOT depend on infrastructure or external SDKs.
- Application MUST NOT import Telethon (`telethon.*`).
- Telegram infrastructure MUST NOT import future Bybit / exchange infrastructure.
- Business logic MUST NOT live in transport / event handlers.
- Telethon events MUST be mapped to internal DTOs before leaving the infrastructure layer.
- External SDKs MUST be isolated behind adapters/factories.
- Handlers MUST be thin: receive → map → dedupe → process → log errors.
- Future pipeline MUST be: Message → Parser → Validator → Risk → Executor (never handler → order).
